# Applied to every repository via core.excludesfile.
#
# Scope rule: this file is for cruft *your machine* creates, not for a
# project's build output. Ignoring project directories globally (node_modules,
# .vscode, .claude) silently hides files that some repos legitimately commit,
# and the problem is invisible when it happens. Put those in the project's own
# .gitignore instead.

# --- macOS ---------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.TemporaryItems
.VolumeIcon.icns
Icon?

# --- editor scratch files ------------------------------------------------
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.netrwhist
tags

# JetBrains writes per-user state here; nobody wants it in review.
.idea/
*.iml

# --- local tooling state -------------------------------------------------
.direnv/

# --- secrets -------------------------------------------------------------
# A safety net, not a strategy. A real secret should never reach a working tree.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.p12
